\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 \strokec2 11. Researcher Behaviour During Testing\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 During testing, the researcher should avoid giving unnecessary instructions.\
Do not say:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls8\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 \'93Press this button.\'94\
\ls8\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 \'93You need to look over there.\'94\
\ls8\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 \'93That is wrong.\'94\
\ls8\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 \'93You are supposed to do this.\'94\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Instead, if the participant is stuck, first ask:\
\'93What would you try next?\'94\
If they remain unable to continue, provide the smallest amount of help required.\
Every time assistance is provided, record it in the Observation Sheet.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 \strokec2 12. When to Provide Assistance\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Provide assistance if:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls9\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 the participant cannot continue after approximately 20\'9630 seconds;\
\ls9\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 they repeatedly perform the same unsuccessful action;\
\ls9\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 they explicitly ask for help;\
\ls9\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 a technical problem prevents progress;\
\ls9\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 continuing may create a safety issue.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Assistance should be minimal.\
Example:\
Participant:\
\'93I don\'92t know how to select it.\'94\
Researcher:\
\'93Try one of the controller triggers.\'94\
Do not give the entire solution unless necessary.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 \strokec2 13. Technical Issues\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 If a technical problem occurs, such as:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls10\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 tracking failure;\
\ls10\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 controller disconnect;\
\ls10\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 object not appearing;\
\ls10\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 interaction not responding;\
\ls10\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 application crash;\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 pause the test.\
Say:\
\'93It looks like there is a technical issue with the prototype. I am going to pause the test briefly.\'94\
Fix the issue and resume from the same task if possible.\
Technical failures should not be counted as participant errors.\
Record them separately in the observation notes.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 \strokec2 14. Post-test Interview\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 After the tasks are complete, help the participant remove the headset.\
Say:\
\'93Thank you. I just have four short questions about your experience.\
There are no right or wrong answers. I am mainly interested in anything that felt clear, unclear, easy, or difficult.\'94\
Ask the following questions.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 \strokec2 Interview Question 1\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

